        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 63,
          "sourceRegion": "Left column, question 23 diagram",
          "description": "A regular heptagon inscribed in a circle, with one vertex at the top, a horizontal bottom side, a centre dot and a dashed radius labelled r to the upper-right vertex. All seven exterior circular segments are shaded.",
          "mathematics": "Seven equally spaced vertices on a common circle; adjacent central angles are 2π/7. The dashed segment joins the centre to a vertex.",
